mes in large teams, they will concurrently be writing documentation to a variety of audiences for a myriad of technical, business, and design needs. Together, students in their teams will write entry-level workflow documents, specifications, planning, marketing, and project management pieces that have the specific task of always moving the team's work forward. The communication tasks are not extras; rather, they are integral to the game dev process. Iterations and deep revising will be part of this process, with inputs from both the CS instructor and the communication instructor.", "catalogBreadth": "", "catalogDistr": "", "catalogEnrollmentPriority": null, "catalogLang": "", "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": "", "catalogAttribute": "", "catalogWhenOffered": "Spring.", "catalogComments": "", "catalogPrereqCoreq": "Corequisite: CS 3152, INFO 3152.", "catalogPrereq": null, "catalogCoreq": null, "catalogFee": "", "catalogSatisfiesReq": "Satisfies the College of Engineering's engineering communication requirement.", "catalogPermission": "", "catalogCourseSubfield": "", "catalogOutcomes": null, "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "EN", "lastTermsOffered": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": []}, {"strm": 2839, "crseId": 355625, "crseOfferNbr": 1, "subject": "ENGRC", "catalogNbr": "3340", "titleShort": "Indep Study in Engr Comm", "titleLong": "Independent Study in Engineering Communications", "crseAttrs": [], "crseAttrValueGroups": [], "enrollGroups": [{"classSections": [{"ssrComponent": "IND", "ssrComponentLong": "Independent Study", "section": "601", "classNbr": 9040, "meetings": [{"classMtgNbr": 1, "timeStart": "", "timeEnd": "", "startDt": "01/23/2023", "endDt": "05/09/2023", "instructors": [{"instrAssignSeq": 2, "netid": "tmn46", "firstName": "Traci", "middleName": "M.", "lastName": "Nathans-Kelly"}], "pattern": "", "facilityDescr": "To Be Assigned", "bldgDescr": null, "facilityDescrshort": "TBA", "meetingTopicDescription": ""}], "notes": [{"classNotesSeq": 1, "descrlong": "Permissio